{
  "_doc": [
    "SRE / HEALTH dashboard (monitoring plan §2.B, 受众: 工程 / 运维).",
    "TEMPLATE — placeholders ${REGION} and ${NAMESPACE} rendered by scripts/lib/render_dashboard.py",
    "before put-dashboard. Edit THIS template, not the rendered output (源在 git — plan 原则1).",
    "",
    "HARD CONSTRAINT (plan 阶段2): every widget is type:metric. NO type:log Insights widgets.",
    "",
    "Latency uses metric EXTENDED STATISTICS (p50/p95/p99) — NOT averages (plan 原则5); the latency",
    "metric is extracted by the metric-filter ($.latencyMs / $.ttfbMs) so percentiles are computed",
    "on the metric, alarmable in 阶段3 (Logs-Insights pct() can only draw, not alarm — plan 风险表).",
    "",
    "失败 vs 中止 separated (plan §2 note): AnswerFailed (real failures, by reason via SEARCH) and",
    "AnswerAborted (user pressed 停止) are DIFFERENT widgets — folding aborts into failures inflates",
    "the failure rate and hides real outages. CardHealth by kind is sparse (dimensioned); SEARCH()",
    "auto-discovers the kinds present. The 成功/失败/中止 count widget uses AnswerFailedTotal (the dense,",
    "un-dimensioned failure counter from alarm-metrics.json) for the 失败（合计）series — a bare",
    "AnswerFailed reference draws nothing because that metric only exists per-reason dimension."
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# source-truth · 健康看板（工程 / 运维）\n顶部为告警状态（绿=正常，红=触发）。以下依次为：回答延迟分位（建议关注 P95/P99，平均值受少数极慢请求影响）、回答结果分布、卡片渲染异常、单次回答的代码检索次数、冷启动。故障排查请用底部的 TraceID 全链路日志查询。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "alarm",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "title": "🚨 告警状态（绿=正常 / 红=触发）：原始工具指令文本泄漏到卡片 · 卡片未正常结束 · 回答失败率激增 · 日志管道中断",
        "alarms": [
          "arn:aws:cloudwatch:${REGION}:${ACCOUNT_ID}:alarm:source-truth-ToolcallLeakDetected",
          "arn:aws:cloudwatch:${REGION}:${ACCOUNT_ID}:alarm:source-truth-FinalizeFailed",
          "arn:aws:cloudwatch:${REGION}:${ACCOUNT_ID}:alarm:source-truth-AnswerFailedBurst",
          "arn:aws:cloudwatch:${REGION}:${ACCOUNT_ID}:alarm:source-truth-LogPipelineStalled"
        ],
        "sortBy": "stateUpdatedTimestamp"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## 核心健康指标（近 1 小时）\n回答成功率、回答总耗时 P95、首字延迟 P95（首字延迟 = 用户发出问题到看到第一个字的时间）。"
